WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.020
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.860
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.860 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.740 --> 00:31.290
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.020
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.530 --> 00:58.300
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.300 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.010
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.010 --> 01:08.860
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.860 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.530 --> 01:25.180
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.850 --> 01:43.210
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.479 --> 01:46.509
=Episode 9=

02:01.760 --> 02:02.440
Senior.

02:08.960 --> 02:09.440
Senior.

02:11.760 --> 02:12.530
Senior Xian Qing.

02:12.530 --> 02:13.040
Senior.

02:18.360 --> 02:18.880
Senior.

02:19.600 --> 02:20.079
How is he?

02:21.240 --> 02:22.079
His injuries are severe.

02:22.680 --> 02:24.000
I'll take him back to Mount Yuqing.

02:24.120 --> 02:24.480
Okay.

02:25.400 --> 02:27.320
Luo, you go with them
to take care of Senior Xian Qing.

02:27.520 --> 02:29.000
Leave Jinzhao and Little Yue to me.

02:37.840 --> 02:38.280
Qi.

02:42.280 --> 02:42.720
Go.

02:47.000 --> 02:47.860
Jinzhao!

02:54.260 --> 02:55.220
Qi.

03:03.920 --> 03:06.000
Qingfei, Luohuan,
I didn't do it on purpose.

03:06.600 --> 03:08.400
I didn't mean to kill them.

03:38.380 --> 03:41.360
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

03:42.510 --> 03:44.690
♪Let go of all regrets♪

03:45.200 --> 03:50.220
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

03:52.050 --> 03:55.380
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

03:56.110 --> 03:59.860
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

04:01.230 --> 04:04.560
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

04:05.840 --> 04:08.140
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

04:08.140 --> 04:11.220
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

04:11.220 --> 04:13.140
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

04:13.140 --> 04:17.360
♪I have no regrets♪

04:17.740 --> 04:22.640
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

04:22.640 --> 04:26.800
♪I pray for a miracle♪

04:26.800 --> 04:28.300
♪Over the time♪

04:28.300 --> 04:30.220
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

04:30.220 --> 04:33.170
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

04:33.170 --> 04:36.370
♪Of being with you forever♪

04:36.370 --> 04:40.530
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

04:41.840 --> 04:48.590
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

04:52.270 --> 04:55.470
♪Miracle♪

04:55.470 --> 04:57.620
♪I will protect you in my life♪

04:57.620 --> 05:01.100
♪That's my love for you♪

05:05.720 --> 05:07.920
Jinzhao.

05:08.120 --> 05:09.640
Jinzhao, are you not better yet?

05:40.440 --> 05:42.560
Qi, let's go.

05:43.000 --> 05:45.080
Time to go to the Fengyan Hotel
to meet Shifang and the others.

05:50.360 --> 05:50.800
Let's go.

05:51.560 --> 05:52.080
Wait.

05:53.920 --> 05:55.570
I think I heard something.

06:02.760 --> 06:03.280
Someone's...

06:08.960 --> 06:09.960
How unlucky we are.

06:10.800 --> 06:12.680
So it's you two.

06:12.800 --> 06:14.640
You goons just delivered

06:14.760 --> 06:16.280
yourselves right to us.

06:18.640 --> 06:21.040
You two were lucky to escape just now.

06:21.160 --> 06:22.880
Now your good luck has run out.

06:22.960 --> 06:26.040
The ones who fled
in a panic last time weren't us.

06:26.560 --> 06:27.320
Let me tell you.

06:27.640 --> 06:28.920
The lake is

06:29.040 --> 06:30.400
where I breed Zhenyao fish.

06:30.920 --> 06:33.960
You can't be arrogant today.

07:11.200 --> 07:12.520
What sorcery is this?

07:24.200 --> 07:24.800
Qi.

07:27.600 --> 07:28.280
Jinzhao.

07:39.320 --> 07:40.360
Jinzhao, are you okay?

07:40.360 --> 07:40.960
Yes.

07:41.280 --> 07:43.360
Find a chance to run
and get Luo for help.

07:43.560 --> 07:44.400
But...

07:46.680 --> 07:47.080
Go.

07:55.840 --> 07:56.480
Are you okay?

07:56.680 --> 07:57.200
Go.

08:05.240 --> 08:05.920
Jinzhao.

08:44.640 --> 08:45.520
Jinzhao.

08:47.720 --> 08:48.480
Jinzhao.

09:24.600 --> 09:26.480
With just one strike?

09:27.240 --> 09:29.320
Demon. This lady is a demon.

09:29.640 --> 09:30.360
Stay calm.

09:31.400 --> 09:32.000
Stay calm.

09:34.800 --> 09:37.400
W-W-We should show them some mercy
and don't go overboard,

09:38.280 --> 09:38.800
right?

09:38.800 --> 09:39.800
Let's retreat for now.

09:40.000 --> 09:40.800
Go!

09:41.160 --> 09:42.120
Go.

09:42.280 --> 09:42.880
Let's go.

09:44.600 --> 09:45.280
Jinzhao.

09:46.000 --> 09:47.220
Jinzhao, wake up.

09:47.920 --> 09:49.640
Don't scare me. Jinzhao.

09:54.100 --> 09:56.680
(Mount Yuqing, a cultivation sect
and earthly paradise)

09:56.680 --> 09:58.880
Master.

10:01.200 --> 10:02.720
Master Luo, don't worry.

10:02.760 --> 10:03.680
My master is right here.

10:03.760 --> 10:04.440
Okay.

10:13.480 --> 10:14.200
Master.

10:18.240 --> 10:19.560
Master, don't be hasty to test me.

10:19.720 --> 10:20.600
Xian Qing is injured.

10:29.810 --> 10:32.300
(Mount Yuqing's leader, Gu Hanjiang)

10:34.400 --> 10:35.520
Xian Qing is injured again?

10:39.840 --> 10:40.440
Bring him in.

11:07.960 --> 11:09.440
My master will treat him.

11:09.840 --> 11:12.080
Master Luo, I'll escort you back.

11:12.920 --> 11:15.200
Okay, I'll just wait at the door.

11:30.040 --> 11:33.040
We're now at Mount Yuqing.

11:33.360 --> 11:35.040
Senior Gu will treat you.

11:36.360 --> 11:39.080
We're all fine.

11:55.680 --> 11:57.440
Senior Gu, thank you.

11:57.560 --> 11:58.200
Don't worry.

13:15.520 --> 13:18.480
(Senior, you must get well soon.)

13:42.120 --> 13:42.680
Master.

13:44.160 --> 13:44.840
How is he doing?

13:45.080 --> 13:47.600
Didn't you always say one as irritating
as him could live a long time?

13:48.240 --> 13:49.260
Master.

13:50.760 --> 13:52.000
He's exhausted his energy.

13:52.600 --> 13:54.360
He probably won't wake up soon.

13:56.200 --> 13:57.400
Even if he wakes up,

13:58.120 --> 14:01.120
his power is likely
to be greatly reduced.

14:49.240 --> 14:50.060
Jinzhao,

14:52.600 --> 14:53.550
wake up.

14:56.560 --> 14:57.360
Jinzhao.

15:18.600 --> 15:20.500
Jinzhao, don't scare me.

15:23.860 --> 15:26.420
♪Let go of all regrets♪

15:26.420 --> 15:31.450
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

15:34.320 --> 15:35.180
Jinzhao,

15:37.720 --> 15:39.520
I don't want to lose you.

15:44.160 --> 15:45.720
I can answer the question

15:46.960 --> 15:49.080
you asked me yesterday.

15:51.040 --> 15:53.600
Even if the master
in my dream comes back,

15:56.600 --> 15:59.200
I won't leave you behind.

15:59.200 --> 16:03.920
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

16:04.200 --> 16:05.120
Jinzhao,

16:06.920 --> 16:09.160
please wake up soon, okay?

16:13.000 --> 16:13.720
Qi,

16:16.480 --> 16:18.960
it's so cold, Qi.

16:22.680 --> 16:23.500
What are you saying?

16:24.320 --> 16:25.420
It's so cold.

16:26.800 --> 16:28.840
Okay, wait for a moment.

16:29.040 --> 16:30.360
I'll go and make a fire for you.

16:35.060 --> 16:37.460
♪My love never stops♪

16:37.460 --> 16:40.500
♪No matter how bumpy
the road to our reunion is♪

16:40.500 --> 16:42.610
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

16:42.610 --> 16:46.740
♪I have no regrets♪

16:47.150 --> 16:52.030
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

16:52.030 --> 16:55.630
♪I pray for a miracle♪

16:56.140 --> 16:57.620
♪Over the time♪

16:57.620 --> 16:59.540
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

16:59.540 --> 17:02.450
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

17:02.450 --> 17:05.980
♪Of being with you forever♪

17:05.980 --> 17:10.770
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

17:11.150 --> 17:13.200
♪I will protect you in my life♪

17:13.200 --> 17:16.660
♪That's my love for you♪

17:20.560 --> 17:21.119
Master.

17:23.839 --> 17:26.319
Master, is there any other way?

17:28.119 --> 17:30.640
Why has he made himself so wretched?

17:32.680 --> 17:33.920
He encountered

17:34.000 --> 17:35.600
someone with half of his energy.

17:36.080 --> 17:38.520
He got seriously injured as he
protected him with all his might.

17:39.080 --> 17:40.440
It's Luo Wangping's child?

17:44.080 --> 17:45.200
I see.

17:45.760 --> 17:46.960
Back then, Luo Wangping promised

17:46.960 --> 17:48.800
to exchange his life
for half of Xian Qing's energy.

17:50.440 --> 17:52.680
But in the end, he broke his promise.

17:53.720 --> 17:55.040
Later, when Xian Qing was weak,

17:55.480 --> 17:56.800
he was attacked by a beast

17:57.600 --> 17:58.800
and nearly lost his life.

18:00.240 --> 18:02.560
We didn't expect after 20 years,

18:02.720 --> 18:04.800
he would meet the child
of the Luo family.

18:07.160 --> 18:08.240
Let's skip this

18:08.520 --> 18:09.400
and look for herbs.

19:40.400 --> 19:42.320
Does this make you feel a bit warmer?

19:45.720 --> 19:50.800
Qi, I've troubled you this time.

19:51.600 --> 19:52.360
No.

19:53.360 --> 19:56.680
You haven't troubled anyone.
Don't talk nonsense.

19:59.360 --> 20:00.640
I'm a bit sleepy.

20:04.720 --> 20:07.080
Don't sleep, Jinzhao.

20:09.120 --> 20:10.220
You can't sleep.

20:11.560 --> 20:12.600
If you fall asleep,

20:13.040 --> 20:15.160
I'll take away all your money.

20:15.680 --> 20:16.960
And the little fish jade pendant.

20:17.520 --> 20:19.200
I'll pawn it off.

20:21.120 --> 20:22.000
Don't leave me alone.

20:24.560 --> 20:26.120
You mustn't pawn the jade pendant.

20:26.900 --> 20:30.070
♪In this lifetime, you are my obsession♪

20:30.320 --> 20:34.930
♪Yet our happy ending remains elusive♪

20:38.200 --> 20:44.040
Okay, you promise you won't sleep.

20:46.520 --> 20:47.360
I won't.

20:48.660 --> 20:53.620
♪Fearful of seeing you again
yet not recognizing you♪

20:53.620 --> 20:57.970
♪Fearful of dreaming of you and parting♪

20:57.970 --> 21:02.140
♪Fearful that promises
will eventually run aground♪

21:02.140 --> 21:06.640
♪Fearful that it will be
an eternal parting♪

21:06.640 --> 21:10.890
♪Fearful of going through reincarnation
and searching through the world♪

21:10.890 --> 21:13.580
♪Only to brush past each other♪

21:22.200 --> 21:24.280
I can't believe I have your energy.

21:24.800 --> 21:26.720
No wonder every time
you transfer your energy to me,

21:27.640 --> 21:29.400
it feels so familiar.

21:31.200 --> 21:31.920
Zhaoyan.

21:33.640 --> 21:35.560
It's been a long time since
I saw someone so innocent.

21:35.960 --> 21:37.520
You are funny and adorable.

21:40.680 --> 21:43.000
(We didn't expect after 20 years,)

21:43.280 --> 21:45.240
(he would meet the child
of the Luo family.)

21:48.600 --> 21:51.680
You say I'm innocent,

21:52.960 --> 21:54.800
but I think you're the innocent one.

21:55.680 --> 21:57.160
You just gave half

21:57.400 --> 21:58.640
of your energy

21:58.760 --> 21:59.960
to a stranger.

22:01.010 --> 22:05.230
♪Fearful of not having
the chance to bid you farewell♪

22:05.230 --> 22:09.620
♪Fearful that my memories
will only be filled with longing♪

22:09.620 --> 22:14.380
♪Fearful of seeing you again
yet not recognizing you♪

22:14.380 --> 22:18.660
♪Fearful of dreaming of you and parting♪

22:19.020 --> 22:23.300
♪Fearful that promises
will eventually run aground♪

22:23.300 --> 22:27.370
♪Fearful that it will be
an eternal parting♪

22:27.560 --> 22:32.200
Our family honors promises
and repays kindness.

22:33.080 --> 22:36.400
I will now return your energy.

22:41.550 --> 22:46.090
♪Wishing to see you again♪

22:46.090 --> 22:50.290
♪Wishing us to be together forever♪

22:50.290 --> 22:54.800
♪Wishing for a world
without the sadness of separation♪

22:54.800 --> 22:58.740
♪Wishing that when I look back,
it feels like our first encounter♪

22:58.740 --> 23:02.160
♪Like our first encounter♪

23:16.760 --> 23:19.640
It seems

23:19.800 --> 23:20.840
this medicine isn't needed.

23:21.800 --> 23:23.480
Your uncle is always giving away.

23:23.800 --> 23:25.400
He probably never thought

23:25.600 --> 23:27.080
that someone would return his energy.

23:28.680 --> 23:31.400
He's magnanimous and worthy
of being the Master of Luo family.

23:33.400 --> 23:37.240
Uncle's concern has not been in vain.

23:42.320 --> 23:45.440
It's late at night.
Go back and rest early.

23:46.320 --> 23:47.520
I'll go to see Yue.

23:48.560 --> 23:51.360
Master, I'll go with you.

23:56.040 --> 23:58.440
Okay, watch your step.

24:25.840 --> 24:26.680
You're really lucky.

24:27.880 --> 24:28.760
Let's handle it.

24:45.280 --> 24:46.080
Internal injuries.

24:47.320 --> 24:48.680
But there's no immediate danger to life.

24:51.800 --> 24:52.760
Miss Shuo Xuan.

24:54.960 --> 24:57.120
Hengdao Sect and Sea of Clear Skies

24:57.240 --> 24:58.240
have an agreement.

24:59.040 --> 25:02.080
Now, Qi and Yue Jinzhao
are under our care.

25:02.760 --> 25:05.280
Why do you keep following them?

25:05.560 --> 25:07.640
May I ask your intention?

25:07.800 --> 25:09.120
This is how you take care of them?

25:09.480 --> 25:10.830
They are badly injured.

25:11.600 --> 25:13.360
No wonder His Lordship
doesn't trust you.

25:14.440 --> 25:16.040
Please go back and tell him.

25:16.960 --> 25:19.760
Right now, Qi and Yue Jinzhao
are undergoing trials.

25:20.000 --> 25:21.920
Everything is under our control.

25:22.200 --> 25:23.120
There's no need to worry.

25:29.560 --> 25:30.160
Someone's coming.

25:30.920 --> 25:32.240
Huan, let's go.

25:38.880 --> 25:39.440
Let's go.

25:57.800 --> 26:00.000
Master, they're over there.

27:02.400 --> 27:03.040
Sorry.

27:28.760 --> 27:30.680
(Zhaoyan gave back)

27:31.600 --> 27:33.080
(my energy.)

28:06.360 --> 28:07.080
Zhaoyan.

28:09.440 --> 28:10.680
You've returned my energy to me.

28:13.200 --> 28:14.320
How will you sustain yourself?

28:15.840 --> 28:17.160
Your energy

28:19.440 --> 28:21.330
can only make me stronger

28:21.760 --> 28:23.200
but can't extend my life.

28:24.760 --> 28:25.880
For you,

28:27.560 --> 28:28.560
it can be of more use.

28:37.120 --> 28:37.800
Zhaoyan,

28:40.040 --> 28:41.200
what on earth do you want?

28:54.800 --> 28:56.200
Today, I coincidentally learned

28:59.000 --> 28:59.960
20 years ago,

29:01.680 --> 29:03.680
my father once had a deal with you.

29:04.840 --> 29:07.080
It turns out that when I was young,

29:09.160 --> 29:11.840
I had already received your kindness.

29:16.080 --> 29:17.880
But my father failed
to fulfill his promise.

29:19.800 --> 29:20.840
I should return

29:22.360 --> 29:24.440
this half of the energy to you.

29:27.640 --> 29:28.560
For thousands of years,

29:29.920 --> 29:32.160
countless people have asked me
for my energy.

29:33.760 --> 29:35.040
I don't care if they can return it.

29:38.840 --> 29:40.880
You are the first one
to return my energy to me.

29:46.520 --> 29:47.200
Zhaoyan,

29:51.520 --> 29:52.480
you returned my energy

29:55.400 --> 29:56.840
just to repay a debt?

29:57.970 --> 30:00.340
♪Look, the leaves are falling like rain♪

30:00.340 --> 30:04.170
♪They symbolize my love♪

30:04.170 --> 30:09.460
♪The distance
that can't be crossed is fate♪

30:14.440 --> 30:15.520
A son should settle

30:17.800 --> 30:18.670
his father's debts.

30:24.560 --> 30:27.230
♪Just one glance
in the vast sea of people♪

30:27.230 --> 30:29.660
♪And I'm lost in you♪

30:30.420 --> 30:34.320
♪My heart can't help
but draw near to you♪

30:34.830 --> 30:37.260
♪Wishing for a perfect ending♪

30:37.260 --> 30:39.700
♪If love arises with the wind♪

30:39.700 --> 30:43.600
♪How do I calm it♪

30:43.600 --> 30:46.130
♪I've given it my all♪

30:48.280 --> 30:48.960
Zhaoyan.

30:49.710 --> 30:52.330
♪Look, the leaves are falling like rain♪

30:54.760 --> 30:56.680
Are you doing this
to sever ties with me?

31:06.040 --> 31:08.720
You became weak because you gave

31:09.640 --> 31:10.840
your energy to me.

31:13.160 --> 31:15.400
And today, you almost lost
your life because of it.

31:17.640 --> 31:19.240
I feel guilty.

31:20.560 --> 31:21.440
I am unworthy...

31:21.680 --> 31:22.520
But I don't care about

31:23.160 --> 31:24.920
my energy or how long I can live.

31:25.040 --> 31:25.760
I do.

31:26.160 --> 31:28.590
♪Just one line from you♪

31:28.590 --> 31:30.960
♪And I was lost in your charm♪

31:32.000 --> 31:32.680
Senior.

31:34.400 --> 31:35.240
I do care.

31:36.460 --> 31:38.640
♪Wishing for a perfect ending♪

31:39.700 --> 31:42.130
♪Look, the leaves are falling like rain♪

31:42.130 --> 31:45.940
♪They symbolize my love♪

31:45.940 --> 31:51.760
♪The distance
that can't be crossed is fate♪

31:52.720 --> 31:54.040
Life

31:55.360 --> 31:56.800
is like a fleeting moment.

31:57.760 --> 31:59.080
What does it matter if one lives

31:59.520 --> 32:01.040
for an instant or for 1,000 years?

32:02.600 --> 32:05.320
Life is precious
regardless of its length.

32:07.880 --> 32:08.480
Senior.

32:11.320 --> 32:12.960
Please don't take life

32:14.560 --> 32:16.520
so lightly anymore.

32:40.800 --> 32:41.600
I won't.

33:50.960 --> 33:51.600
Zhaoyan,

33:53.280 --> 33:55.240
do you know losing the demonic power

33:55.680 --> 33:57.560
will make your body even weaker?

34:01.280 --> 34:02.480
I don't want to owe others.

34:04.120 --> 34:06.800
Besides, I already had it for 20 years.

34:09.199 --> 34:09.800
Maiming,

34:11.239 --> 34:12.600
I don't want
to argue over this with you.

34:13.600 --> 34:14.040
Alright.

34:16.400 --> 34:18.360
I'll say something you'd like to hear.

34:20.560 --> 34:25.480
The Zhengwu Alliance has annihilated
the Qiyuan Sect's Jiangning stronghold.

34:27.920 --> 34:30.639
I'm also very concerned
about Bian Luohuan's escape.

34:31.320 --> 34:33.719
I will go to
the Zhengwu Alliance immediately

34:34.080 --> 34:35.520
to check for any further clues.

34:45.080 --> 34:46.000
Is it very funny?

34:47.000 --> 34:50.080
As expected of you.

34:51.159 --> 34:54.360
Once I mention the Qiyuan Sect,
you immediately perk up.

34:55.560 --> 34:57.360
Since you've already returned
the demonic power,

34:58.000 --> 35:00.200
be sure to take care of yourself.

35:11.600 --> 35:13.080
Zhaoyan.

35:16.120 --> 35:18.840
You're so eager to establish

35:19.280 --> 35:20.840
achievement and career.

35:36.600 --> 35:38.000
This time, you got drained a lot,

35:38.400 --> 35:40.000
so I got you some medicine to replenish

35:40.640 --> 35:41.280
your energy.

35:44.280 --> 35:44.840
Thank you.

35:46.760 --> 35:48.800
Before you went down
the mountain to travel with Xiu,

35:48.960 --> 35:50.200
I divined a fortune for you.

35:50.720 --> 35:53.680
The divination showed
that you'd face a love tribulation.

35:56.600 --> 35:57.420
A love tribulation?

35:59.400 --> 36:01.760
Whether it is a calamity
or fate is not yet certain.

36:04.560 --> 36:06.200
It seems you are serious this time.

36:06.600 --> 36:08.720
For thousands of years,
you have not been serious.

36:08.920 --> 36:11.600
I've never seen
you take someone so seriously.

36:13.600 --> 36:14.640
It might be

36:16.200 --> 36:18.760
because I've never met
such a special lady.

37:10.560 --> 37:14.240
♪A meteor streaking across the sky♪

37:15.590 --> 37:18.160
♪Burns what once was♪

37:19.680 --> 37:22.510
♪The name is forgotten♪

37:26.600 --> 37:30.120
♪The deep feelings are hidden
behind the mask♪

37:31.520 --> 37:34.560
♪Only through the eyes♪

37:35.430 --> 37:38.480
♪Who can see them clearly♪

37:40.640 --> 37:46.680
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

37:48.400 --> 37:54.760
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

37:56.610 --> 38:04.100
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

38:04.650 --> 38:11.140
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

38:28.580 --> 38:32.570
♪The seemingly random paths♪

38:33.600 --> 38:36.460
♪The burning traces♪

38:37.540 --> 38:41.510
♪Behind them are all secrets♪

38:44.640 --> 38:48.940
♪Those unexpected encounters♪

38:49.570 --> 38:52.860
♪Are all carefully♪

38:53.640 --> 38:57.090
♪Arranged by me♪

38:58.560 --> 39:05.510
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

39:06.560 --> 39:13.540
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

39:14.560 --> 39:22.150
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

39:22.670 --> 39:29.830
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

39:30.310 --> 39:38.100
♪I'm destined to give my all for you♪

39:38.560 --> 39:46.120
♪Even if my efforts may go up in smoke♪

39:46.500 --> 39:54.580
♪I am madly in love with you
and will do everything for you♪

39:54.580 --> 40:02.720
♪Leaving behind proof of my love♪
